{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01RFx3sxHpGvQaP3M7hZmZx4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015iXjmj6vRw4NZgwChwbHzR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/yosefgamble/github/Aurialis\ngit add src/components/mastering/MasterScreen.tsx src/components/mastering/__tests__/MasterScreen.test.tsx src/app/master/page.tsx ralph/fix_plan.md\ngit status --short\ngit commit -q -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nrefactor(master): extract MasterScreen from the duplicated mode-switch\n\nThe simple/advanced/deep control switch was inlined twice in\nsrc/app/master/page.tsx — once in the desktop inspector (AnimatePresence\nslide) and once in the mobile \"Show … Controls\" drawer — with identical\nprops. Extract both into a single <MasterScreen mode=...> component\nparameterized by an `animated` flag and a `testIdSuffix` (\"\" / \"-mobile\"),\nso the two call sites share one source of truth and every E2E data-testid\n(auto-master-progress[-mobile], auto-master-error[-mobile]) is preserved.\n\nDrops the now-unused SimpleMastering/AdvancedMastering/DeepMastering and\nAnimatePresence imports from the page. RTL test covers mode routing, the\nauto-master analyzing/error readouts, the mobile testid suffix, and the\nanimated variant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit MasterScreen extraction"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":474,"cache_read_input_tokens":156627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":474},"output_tokens":60,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"243c3f7c-ee0e-426f-a231-33e2ba1d8e5c","uuid":"de734c15-0f51-4f0a-8290-7b4281dfc1eb","request_id":"req_011CcaiEbuBz2oXrqa6